        </div>
        <div class="svc-card">
          <div class="svc-card__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 19V5M4 19h16M8 15l3-3 3 2 4-5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div>
          <div><h3>Growth strategy</h3><p>Financial guidance for sustainable development in a dynamic, competitive business environment.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="svc-why reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="svc-why__inner">
        <h2>Why trust us</h2>
        <p>Over 25 years of experience means we have seen most situations a business can find itself in — and we know which approach works in practice, not just in theory.</p>
        <p>We give you clear, actionable advice in plain language — no complicated terms hiding uncertainty. Our goal is for you to understand not only what to do, but why.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="svc-faq reveal">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" class="faq-question">How much does a consultation cost? <span>+</span></button><div class="faq-answer">From 50 € per hour. The exact amount depends on the type and scope of the question. Contact us to discuss your case and receive a quote.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" class="faq-question">Can I get a consultation without being your accounting client? <span>+</span></button><div class="faq-answer">Yes. Consulting is entirely separate — you don't need to change your current accountant to get a competent opinion from us.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" class="faq-question">Sole trader or limited company — which is right for me? <span>+</span></button><div class="faq-answer">It depends on your activity and level of risk. With a limited company your personal assets are protected; as a sole trader you are liable with all your assets. Contact us for a specific assessment.</div></div>
      <div class="faq-item"><button type="button" class="faq-question">Do you work with clients outside Sofia? <span>+</span></button><div class="faq-answer">Yes. Consultations can also be held remotely.</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="svc-cta reveal">
    <div class="svc-cta__inner">
      <h2>Have a specific question about your business?</h2>
      <p>Contact us for a consultation tailored to your situation — clear answers you can rely on.</p>
      <div class="svc-cta__actions">
        <a href="tel:+359879884488" class="btn btn-orange">Call +359 879 88 44 88</a>
        <a href="/en/contact#contact-form" class="btn btn-outline" data-open-enquiry="">Request a Consultation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div id="enquiryModal" class="modal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-content" data-form-section="" data-form-lang="en" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="enquiryModalTitle" aria-modal="true">
      <button type="button" id="closeModal" aria-label="Close">×</button>
      <h2 id="enquiryModalTitle">Send an enquiry</h2>
      <p>You can reach us through the enquiry form or directly by phone or email.</p>
